{"id": "1731049", "name": "ב R^4 עם הסקלארית, למצוא בסיס או\"נ לתת מרחב ואז לחשב הטלה עליו", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "innerproduct", "params": ["x", "y"], "body": "block([listarith],listarith:true,ratsimp(conjugate(x).y))"}, {"name": "matrix_gs", "params": ["M"], "body": "block(MM:args(transpose(M)),n:length(MM),if n=1 then return(M) else(for index:2 thru n do(\nnewV:MM[index], for index2:1 thru index-1 do (newV:newV-innerproduct(MM[index],MM[index2])/innerproduct(MM[index2],MM[index2])*MM[index2]),\nMM[index]:newV)), transpose(apply(matrix,MM)))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>במרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span> עם המכפלה הסקלארית, מוגדר תת המרחב הבא:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[W= \\text{span}\\left\\{{{CT:0}},\\; {{CT:1}},\\;{{CT:2}}\\right\\}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו בסיס או\"נ ל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> שנסמנו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w_1,w_2,w_3\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(w_1=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(w_2=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(w_3=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>נגדיר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[v={{CT:3}}\\]</p><p>חשבו את ההטלה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span></p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "units: if is(innerproduct(ans1,ans1)=1) and is(innerproduct(ans2,ans2)=1) and is(innerproduct(ans3,ans3)=1) then true else false;\nperp:  if is(innerproduct(ans1,ans2)=0) and is(innerproduct(ans1,ans3)=0) and is(innerproduct(ans2,ans3)=0) then true else false;\ninW: if is(rank(addcol(baseW,ans1))=3) and is(rank(addcol(baseW,ans2))=3) and is(rank(addcol(baseW,ans3))=3) then true else false;\ncorrect: units and perp and inW;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: is(equal(ans4, vW));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["MM", "baseW", "mat", "mat_gs", "matrixEntry", "n", "newV", "vW", "vv", "w1", "w2", "w3", "ws"], "nvariants": 50}